# The stage0 compiler's model: rows grouped into entities. An entity is the
# `<name> is <kind>` row that starts it and every row after it up to the next
# `is` row; each of those rows has the entity's name as its subject (the
# formatter's layout, which stage0 requires). An entity records its name, its
# kind, and the run of rows it owns, and a map finds a module-level entity by
# its name. Calls, tasks, and regions are not in the map: each belongs to the
# operation its `in` row names, so the same name may serve several operations.
#
# A program is several modules, one after another, each beginning with its
# `<name> is module` entity. A module is entered in the map by its name, and
# every other module-level entity by `<module>.<name>`, so two modules may use
# the same names.
#
# Kinds are numbered by their row in the `kinds` table: 1 module, 2 capability,
# 3 constant, 4 operation, 5 call, 6 record, 7 enum, 8 typeInstance, 9 region,
# 10 task, 11 table, 12 operationType.
# Any other kind is outside the stage0 subset.

model is module
model purpose "Group rows into entities and find an entity by its name"
model path model
model imports standard.string
model imports standard.list
model imports standard.map
model imports standard.math
model imports standard.compare
model imports standard.logic
model imports standard.test
model imports lexer
model imports syntax
model exports Entity
model exports Entities
model exports EntityNames
model exports buildModel

KindRow is record
KindRow purpose "One entity kind stage0 compiles, numbered by its row"
KindRow typeParameter none
KindRow field text String

kinds is table
kinds purpose "The entity kinds of the stage0 subset; a kind's number is its row's position"
kinds rowType KindRow
kinds row moduleRow 1
kinds row capabilityRow 2
kinds row constantRow 3
kinds row operationRow 4
kinds row callRow 5
kinds row recordRow 6
kinds row enumRow 7
kinds row typeInstanceRow 8
kinds row regionRow 9
kinds row taskRow 10
kinds row tableRow 11
kinds row operationTypeRow 12
kinds cell moduleRow text "module"
kinds cell capabilityRow text "capability"
kinds cell constantRow text "constant"
kinds cell operationRow text "operation"
kinds cell callRow text "call"
kinds cell recordRow text "record"
kinds cell enumRow text "enum"
kinds cell typeInstanceRow text "typeInstance"
kinds cell regionRow text "region"
kinds cell taskRow text "task"
kinds cell tableRow text "table"
kinds cell operationTypeRow text "operationType"

